))\n          blocks)))\n\n\n(def ^:private file* (delay (read-file)))\n\n\n(defn fixture\nLoading initial Timbre config from: :default\n\nRunning tests in #{\"test\"}\nWARNING: load already refers to: #'clojure.core/load in namespace: yin.vm.encoder, being replaced by: #'yin.vm.encoder/load\n\nTesting yin.vm.ucf.rows-test\ndocs/design/yin.vm.ucf-transport-tuples.md:349:envelope names the pending's module. `op-id` is `{:yin.k/occurrence P :yin.k/seq n}` as plain data or nil,\ndocs/design/yin.vm.ucf-transport-tuples.md:356:An `:install` pending is never sufficient alone: the root's installs\ndocs/design/yin.vm.ucf-transport-tuples.md:374:`:ffi`/`:ffi-request` pendings carry are the `task` input of\ndocs/design/yin.vm.ucf-transport-tuples.md:401:child task's kind is `:blocked` (`:install-child`), the only kind the\ndocs/design/yin.vm.ucf-transport-tuples.md:433:   kind             ; :blocked | :parked | :halted\ndocs/design/yin.vm.ucf-transport-tuples.md:444:   frames           ; crefs to :wait rows, IN WAIT ORDER   (:blocked, :parked)\ndocs/design/yin.vm.ucf-transport-tuples.md:456:`:yin.k/modules` and `:yin.k/host-exports`, using `{}` when empty, just as\ndocs/design/yin.vm.ucf-transport-tuples.md:460:modules); the host-export map records profile keywords for used qualified\ndocs/design/yin.vm.ucf-transport-tuples.md:461:exports only. Implementation and re-mint are pending the address-value type\ndocs/design/yin.vm.ucf-transport-tuples.md:462:resolution recorded in I-8: Part B.1.3 says string-or-nil, whereas registry\ndocs/design/yin.vm.ucf-transport-tuples.md:465:Kind rules are §7.2.1's: `:blocked` has nonempty frames and neither\ndocs/design/yin.vm.ucf-transport-tuples.md:478:| root | blocked / parked | exclusive | `{:yin.k/policy :yin.k/exclusive :yin.k/occurrence :yin.k/arbitration :yin.k/next-op-seq}` plus `:yin.k/origin` on every successor, absent on a first export |\ndocs/design/yin.vm.ucf-transport-tuples.md:479:| root | blocked / parked | fork | nil |\ndocs